        "date": "2026-11-15T18:05:04Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(2d): Side Auto keeps the outline law where no section reads material\n\nA sheet part (a flat disc, a bored flat plate) has no section at any\nlevel, so the level probes read no material on either side. In that\ncase the part's XY outline decides, as before #1933. The outline is\ncomputed only then. Material on both sides with no decision still\nrefuses by name.\n\nRefs #1933\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
